 chy of human worth. Instead\, it has become a permanent argument. Ava DuVe
 rnay’s 14th pulls this constitutional fight out of the footnotes and int
 o the present\, chronicling the vicious battle over the amendment that has
  raged for over 150 years. Threading deep archival scholarship with pierci
 ng headlines of today\, 14th brings together legal minds\, politicians\, h
 istorians and cultural voices in direct conversation with a question Ameri
 ca still hasn’t settled: Who gets to belong?\nhttps://booking.landmarkth
